{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24703","headline":"斋居偶作 · 白居易","name":"斋居偶作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"童子装炉火，行添一炷香。\n老翁持麈尾，坐拂半张牀。\n卷缦看天色，移斋近日阳。\n甘鲜新饼果，稳暖旧衣裳。\n止足安生理，悠闲乐性场。\n是非一以遣，动静百无妨。\n岂有物相累，兼无情可忘。\n不须忧老病，心是自医王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24703.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24703","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}